    "body": "This appears to be a misunderstanding.\r\n\r\nWhile the port indeed does not get changed, the underlying URL has been manipulated (in particular its host) as part of the host state.\r\n\r\nYou are correct that callers ignore the failure return value, but I don't think that warrants introducing additional branching to return nothing for those specific callers.",
